WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.400
Four changes keeping four silences apart.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.000
And every one of them read like this.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.300
That instruction is right for one of the four.

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.600
The set stays closed, and small.

5
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.400
The situation travels with the sentence.

6
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.200
And one of them must not say try again.

7
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.400
Eight pins moved, and the gate said so first.

8
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.900
The chips still need the candidates.

9
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:35.100
Five situations, and the reader saw one.
